  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basin Management Support for Resilient, Inclusive Growth &amp; Harmonized Transformation ( BRIGHT) for the NationalIWRM Program of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basin Development Support for Resilient, Inclusive Growth and Harmonized Transformation in the Water Sector of Ethiopia (BRIGHT) project is financed by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands with contribution from European Union. The project is implemented by Water and Land Resources in collaboration with the Ethiopian Ministry of Water and Energy.  to improve resilience and reduce vulnerability of population to drought and climate change in Ethiopia. The ultimate objective of the project to improve Integrated Water Resources Management(IWRM) in the five basins of Ethiopia, namely; Abbay, Awash, Rift Valley, Omo-Gibe and Tekeze river basins,</narrative>
  </description>
